Ka&#351;l&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3LMZA style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>                                     </span>Kahramanmara&#351;<span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>                                                   </span>Düzce<span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>                                                         </span>Aksaray<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3LMZA style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>                                       </span>Olcay
K&#305;lavuz<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>                                                </span>Halil
Öztürk<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>                                              </span>&#304;brahim
